                      {
                        "text": "Roadside service expenses"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Missed deliveries"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Trailer damage"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Lost productivity"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "DOT violations"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Safety risks for drivers and others on the road"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-cost-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That's why proactive maintenance matters. Businesses like Sun State Trailers focus on helping customers prevent problems before they create bigger disruptions.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-3",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/how-to-spot-problems-before-a-semi-trailer-tire-blowout/3.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Technician inspecting under a trailer near the wheel wells for wear"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-schedule-build",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Building a Smarter Preventive Maintenance Schedule for Semi Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "schedule-build"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-schedule-build-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every operation is different, but consistent inspections and service intervals are key to keeping trailers road-ready. A preventive maintenance schedule for semi trailers should be based on:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-schedule-build-2",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Mileage"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Trailer age"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Load frequency"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Road conditions"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Tire performance history"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Manufacturer recommendations"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-schedule-build-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Staying organized with maintenance records can also help fleet managers spot patterns before problems become serious.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-schedule",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Dependable Service Matters",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "schedule"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-schedule-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Don't wait until a semi-trailer tire blowout leaves you stranded on the side of the road. Whether you need inspections, repairs, or help building a preventive maintenance routine, <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a> is ready to help.",
